e possible to use alias email addresses as the send address<\/h2>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>- if they have been added to the parent gmail address as alias.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<h2>In case of Error 400: redirect_uri_mismatch - on oauth sign up<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFix the redirect url - by referencing url presented in the detailed error page (.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSend test mail to check.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIn the end - check the to address - to view the mail sent from the system.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/wordpress\/send_gmail\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/wordpress\/send_gmail\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/wordpress\/permissions' data-target='computer\/program\/wordpress\/permissions' data-title='Permissions' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Permissions<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/wordpress\/setup' data-target='computer\/program\/wordpress\/setup' data-title='Setup' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resour